OL,4,CFlights cancelled in Belgium due to    
OL,5,Ccost-of-living strike                  
OL,6,GHundreds of flights have been          
OL,7,Gcancelled and public transport         
OL,8,Gseverely disrupted across Belgium as a 
OL,9,Gresult of a strike against planned     
OL,10,Gausterity measures.                    
OL,12,FAll air traffic has been halted at     
OL,13,FBrussels Airport in Zaventem as well   
OL,14,Fas at Charleroi, home to low-cost      
OL,15,Fairlines such as Ryanair.              
OL,17,FUnderground services have also been    
OL,18,Fhalted in capital Brussels, where      
OL,19,Flarge numbers of people joined a       
OL,20,Fprotest march.                         
